dates rejecting v1
description "else reject, on a range where no missing day is ever met (on a range with a 29 February in it, one is met inside the range and the check stops). It is there to hold the generated code to the reference interpreter"

inputs
  origin : date  range >=2001-03-01 <=2003-12-31

date year_later = origin
  + 12 months else reject
date year_before = origin
  - 1 year else reject
